01:00:24.790 --> 01:00:32.290
<v Jan>I'm 29 years with my wife. If I focus on all the bad things that I said about her, then we would never get married.
<v Jan>“我和我妻子在一起29年了。如果我盯着那期间我说过的所有坏话看，那我们根本就不会结婚。”

01:00:32.290 --> 01:00:35.750
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

